| [CX4]([CH2][OX2]C(=O)c1cc(O*)c(O*)c(O*)c1) | PE-Gallic gallate ester | C(COC(=O)c1cc(OCC)c(OCC)c(OCC)c1)(CO)(CO)CO | CCOC(=O)CC |
| c1cc(O[CX4])c(O[CX4])cc1 | Dialkoxybenzyl 3,4 | COc1ccc(CN2CCCCC2)cc1OC | c1ccccc1 |
| c1cc(O[CX4])cc(O[CX4])c1 | Dialkoxybenzyl 3,5 | COc1cc(CN2CCCCC2)cc(OC)c1 | c1ccccc1 |
| N1CCN(CCO)CC1 | HPRZ (1-hydroxyethyl piperazine) | OCCN1CCN(C(=O)CC)CC1 | N1CCNCC1 |
