Complete LOO-CV benchmark for the v19 dataset (226 compounds, 10 April 2026 cut).

| **Method** | **Pooled MAE** | **±0.08 Rate** | **PE-Tris MAE** | **GA-Tris MAE** | **sSS MAE** | **PEg MAE** | **DAB MAE** |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| arch_coarse mean (LOO) | 0.116 | 49% | 0.053 | 0.087 | 0.128 | 0.201 | 0.342 |
| Family GPR engineered | 0.154 | 38% | 0.087 | 0.082 | 0.168 | 0.196 | 0.324 |
| Family SVR | 0.158 | 41% | 0.094 | 0.090 | 0.172 | 0.205 | 0.338 |
| Tanimoto KNN-3 within family | 0.173 | 32% | 0.102 | 0.099 | 0.189 | 0.224 | 0.361 |
